.SH NAME
lean-secret-inject - Inject stored secrets into the active .env


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlean secret inject [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Decrypt all secrets for the profile and write them into .env
(or the profile file). Existing keys are overwritten.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for inject

.PP
\fB-p\fP, \fB--profile\fP=""
	Target profile (default: active)


